\subsection{Conformal Confidence Sets for Gating}
\label{sec:adaptive_k_method}

Experiments reveal that unconditional correction is universally harmful: CRM applied at every step degrades all four LIBERO suites (up to $-$14.8\,pp; Section~\ref{sec:failure_modes}). The 80--97\% of steps where the VLA is already confident receive corrections that are noise. The solution is a conformal confidence set that detects confident steps and gates correction accordingly.

